Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:07.00,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's another top 10 win for Diana Shnaider, her third of the year,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N施奈德又一次击败前十选手\N这是她今年第三次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:13.20,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and this one takes her into the quarterfinals in Wuhan for the very first time{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一场让她\N首次闯进武汉八强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:23.70,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}at the expense of Karolina Muchova, whose charge towards the WTA Finals still not confirmed yet.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N代价是穆霍娃\N她冲击年终总决赛的资格\N还没有锁定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:27.38,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}15{\fs68}日上午
