Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:32.89,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}对阵{\fs78}11{\fs68}号种子施奈德
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:35.84,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}前一天 穆霍娃打了将近{\fs78}3{\fs68}个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.42,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}两个抢七都赢下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:39.50,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}才逆转麦克纳莉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.65,0:00:42.17,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}第一盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 施奈德的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:44.33,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}一共争夺了{\fs78}24{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.33,0:00:46.42,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}穆霍娃{\fs78}3{\fs68}次拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:50.09,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}次只差一分 {\fs78}3{\fs68}次都没能跨过去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:54.48,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A number of points in quite quick succession.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N几分打得节奏很快
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:00:58.58,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Doesn't waste time between her first and second serves either.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一发二发之间也不浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:07.74,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How good was that volley?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这记截击太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:12.15,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 穆霍娃发球 {\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}15{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:14.48,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}只差一分就能{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.48,0:01:17.22,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}接下来 施奈德连拿四分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:19.08,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}30{\fs68}这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:20.85,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她一直压在网前截击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:23.39,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}把穆霍娃调得满场跑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:41.02,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it's Harry Potter stuff out there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球简直像变魔术
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.18,0:01:58.42,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A big finish to a big opening set from Diana Shnaider.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N施奈德漂亮收下这关键的首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:02:03.74,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Almost an hour and a quarter it took to separate these two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两人足足打了将近一小时一刻钟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:09.70,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But it's the world number 13 who strikes first.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第{\fs78}13{\fs68}先下一城
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:15.99,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}第二盘第三局 穆霍娃{\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:18.22,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}又连丢四分 被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:21.65,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 她拿到这一盘唯一的破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:24.24,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她压到网前 施奈德一记穿越
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:26.45,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}从她身边打了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:30.04,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The draw has opened up a little bit.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个签区已经松动了一些
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.70,0:02:40.86,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 穆霍娃发球 必须保住
